# Folder structure

Canonical doc: `docs/FOLDER_STRUCTURE.md`

## Allowed top-level (tracked)

`.cursor/`, `docs/`, `src/`, `engine_ext/` (p6-01: our C++ classes put on a copy of the pinned engine — never engine files), `scripts/`, `tests/`, plus root config (`README.md`, `AGENTS.md`, `pyproject.toml`, `.gitignore`).

## Local only (gitignored)

`.local/{polystrata,ghidra-projects,models,out}/` — engines, Ghidra projects, weights. Never commit.  
See `docs/GITIGNORE_POLICY.md`.

Do **not** invent tracked top-level dirs (`lib/`, `core/`, `utils/`, `data/`, `tmp/`) without updating `FOLDER_STRUCTURE.md` first.  
Do **not** vendor PolyStrata or Ghidra into `src/` or tracked tree.

## Code placement

| Kind | Path |
|------|------|
| Library | `src/stratashift/{cli,ingest,meta,stream,quant,polystrata,monitor,feedback}/` |
| PoC | `scripts/` only (no imports from `src` into scripts long-term) |
| Tests | `tests/test_*.py` |
| Specs | `docs/` |
| REA notes | `docs/rea/` only |
| Goal records | `docs/work/<goal-id>.md` |

## Area responsibilities

- `ingest` — headers/offsets, never full model load or packing
- `stream` — mmap chunk I/O loop
- `quant` — pure pack/quantize, no file I/O
- `polystrata` — engine headers/alignment/index (from REA)
- `cli` — argv only, call into modules

## Rules

- One package root: `src/stratashift`. No parallel business packages.
- No `utils/` / `helpers/` / `common/` dumping grounds.
- New package → update `FOLDER_STRUCTURE.md` + `MODULE_DESIGN.md` before creating dirs.
- Dir names: `snake_case`. Prefer depth `src/stratashift/<area>/<file.py>`.
